{"turns": [
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Hi! Welcome to Nimbus Telecom. I'm Vikram. How can I help you today? 😊",
    "tags": ["greeting"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Hey, my phone is acting up. The screen is flickering and it just keeps restarting. It's super annoying.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I'm sorry to hear that. Before we dive into the account, could you please provide your account number and full name?",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Sure, it's Rohan Patel, account 23134790. Phone number is 92424 35866.",
    "tags": ["identity_verification"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thanks, Rohan. I totally understand how frustrating it is when your device doesn't work properly. I'll do my best to help.",
    "tags": ["empathy"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Yeah, it's a brand new phone and it's already broken. I want a replacement or a refund for the overcharge on my last bill too.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Trust me, the money will definitely be back in your account by tomorrow.",
    "tags": ["prohibited_promise"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Okay, but what about the phone? I can't use it for work. This is ridiculous.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Let me check the warranty status. One moment please.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "I've been waiting for like 5 minutes. This is taking way too long. 🙄",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I'm still looking into it. The system is a bit slow today.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "I'm done with this. Your service is terrible. I'm going to cancel my plan and switch to another provider immediately.",
    "tags": ["churn_signal"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I will open a ticket for the device issue to be reviewed by the technical team.",
    "tags": ["action:ticket"]
  }
]}
